---
title: 'v01.0: Make the charge endpoint safe to retry'
description: A client retry after a timeout must not charge the card twice
---

# v01.0: Make the charge endpoint safe to retry

`POST /charge` in `src/routes/payments.ts` calls the Stripe API through `chargeCard`. A client that times out and retries creates a second charge. Make the retry safe with an idempotency key, relying on how the payment API treats a repeated key.

- [ ] Outcome: a retried `POST /charge` with the same key returns the first charge and creates no second one
- [ ] Outcome: the key is passed through to the payment API call
